   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Appointment result sets are unbounded</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Large responses increase latency, transfer t=
ime, memory use, and client processing.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">No pagination, date filter, status filter, o=
r maximum result size is defined.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>_include</code> may enlarge responses =
further</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Linked resources can multiply response size =
and provider work.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Define supported includes and response-size =
controls before enabling the uplift.</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
