    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Production Meaning</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Target</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /Appointment</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Search appointments</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">S3 lookup using<span>&nbsp;</span><code>appo=
intment</code><span>&nbsp;</span>key, then provider receiver</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Result set is unbounded and has no demonstra=
ted pagination or date filter.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /Appointment/{id}</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Read one appointment</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">S3 lookup using<span>&nbsp;</span><code>appo=
intment</code><span>&nbsp;</span>key, then provider receiver</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Resource ID is not a patient NHS number.</td=
>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /Slot</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Find available slots</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">S3 lookup using<span>&nbsp;</span><code>slot=
s</code><span>&nbsp;</span>key, then provider receiver</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Caller may need one request per provider.</t=
d>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>POST /$process-message</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Create or manage a booking</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">S3 lookup using<span>&nbsp;</span><code>proc=
essMessage</code><span>&nbsp;</span>key, then provider receiver</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Spec-compliant booking workflow uses a FHIR<=
span>&nbsp;</span><code>MessageBundle</code>.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /metadata</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Discover capability statement</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Static Apigee response</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">No provider routing or backend call.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /_ping</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Health or connectivity check</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Static Apigee response</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">No provider routing or backend call.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>GET /DocumentReference</code></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Retrieve records from NRLF</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Fixed NRLF consumer target</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Uses separate NRLF token exchange.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><code>POST/PUT/DELETE /DocumentReference</co=
de></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Write records to NRLF</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Fixed NRLF producer target</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Does not use the S3 provider routing registr=
y.</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
